# Application Standards

## Candidate criteria

Read `4 - Reference/candidate-profile.md` before assessing any role:

- Salary floor (base only; equity does not count)
- Remote/location requirements
- Target roles and career-direction flags

Flag violations; the user may still choose to proceed. Do not unilaterally skip roles.

## Resume versioning

- Copy the latest PDF from `design/exports/`
- Preserve the original filename exactly (read current filename from candidate profile)
- Never rename the resume when copying into application folders

## Combined PDF naming

Use `<ResumePrefix>_<Company>_<ShortRole>.pdf` — read prefix from candidate profile.

## Commits

- All application files belong in the repo; no gitignore exclusions for application artifacts
- Commit message format: `Add <Company> application — <Job Title>`
- Only commit when the user explicitly requests it

## Equity

Link to `4 - Reference/equity-compensation-negotiation.md` for standing position; do not restate full reasoning in per-application docs.
